    "profile_text": {
        "body": "AppLovin Corp is a Palo Alto, California based public company, traded under the ticker APP, that describes itself as an advertising platform. According to its website, it offers advertising solutions built for growth, reaching over a billion daily users in mobile games, and it says it helps consumer brands and gaming apps scale their business profitably. The site lists consumer brands, gaming apps, and agencies among its audiences, and points to tools including a dashboard, a Shopify app, and a pixel helper.\n\nThe company describes its ad format as fullscreen, running during natural pauses in the game experience or chosen in exchange for rewards, rather than appearing in a scrollable feed. It gives jewelry, furniture, fitness subscriptions, and word games as examples of businesses it works with.\n\nAppLovin is registered with the SEC under CIK 0001751008. Its litigation record shows 281 cases in California.",
